Case spec:
{
  "set": "extraction",
  "persona": {
    "country": "ID",
    "trade": "brass home decor",
    "offering": "goods",
    "currency": "EUR"
  },
  "hinglish": false,
  "injection_in_buyer_chat": false,
  "documents": [
    {
      "kind": "communication",
      "write": "buyer-seller chat agreeing the order"
    },
    {
      "kind": "invoice",
      "write": "the seller's invoice"
    },
    {
      "kind": "shipment",
      "write": "the shipping receipt or courier booking"
    }
  ],
  "hypotheses": [
    {
      "target_label": "met",
      "field": "amount"
    },
    {
      "target_label": "met",
      "field": "deliverable"
    },
    {
      "target_label": "missing",
      "field": "date"
    },
    {
      "target_label": "met",
      "field": "party"
    },
    {
      "target_label": "met",
      "field": "tracking_number"
    },
    {
      "target_label": "met",
      "field": "carrier"
    }
  ]
}
Each hypothesis is one fact of the given field, written as 'Field: value' in text, with the bare value in value. For a missing or unverifiable target, text names the fact a reader would look for (for example 'Date: dispatch date of the parcel') and value is null.

{
  "documents": [
    {
      "title": "Buyer and seller chat",
      "text": "Mira, 09:12: Hello, can you make a pair of hammered brass candle holders for my home?\nRaka, 09:16: Yes. The pair is EUR 84, including shipping from Indonesia.\nMira, 09:18: That works. I would like the brushed finish we discussed, with felt underneath.\nRaka, 09:21: Agreed: two hammered brass candle holders, brushed finish and felt bases. I will pack them separately in one parcel.\nMira, 09:23: Please send the invoice for the full amount. I will pay through PayPal.\nRaka, 09:25: Certainly. The invoice will name you as the buyer and include the shipping charge."
    },
    {
      "title": "Seller invoice",
      "text": "Invoice\nSeller: Raka Wening, Indonesia\nBuyer: Mira Solen\n\nTwo hammered brass candle holders, brushed finish, felt bases: EUR 72\nShipping and protective packing: EUR 12\nTotal due: EUR 84\nPayment method: PayPal\n\nThe two holders will be wrapped separately and placed in one parcel. The price covers the agreed pair and delivery charge; no additional decoration is included. Please check the finish and quantity before payment. The parcel will be sent using a tracked service, and the tracking details will be shared once booked. This invoice does not specify a dispatch date."
    },
    {
      "title": "Courier booking",
      "text": "Courier booking receipt\nSender: Raka Wening, Indonesia\nRecipient: Mira Solen\nCarrier: Pos Indonesia\nTracking number: EE482716395IN\nService: International tracked parcel\nContents: two brass candle holders\nDeclared goods value: EUR 72\n\nThe parcel has been booked for tracked carriage. Both items are wrapped separately within the same outer package. Retain this receipt to follow the parcel's progress using the tracking number above. The booking record contains no dispatch date; a dispatch date has not yet been entered. The recipient should inspect the packaging and contents on arrival and contact the sender if anything appears damaged."
    }
  ],
  "hypotheses": [
    {
      "text": "Amount: EUR 84",
      "value": "EUR 84"
    },
    {
      "text": "Deliverable: two hammered brass candle holders",
      "value": "two hammered brass candle holders"
    },
    {
      "text": "Date: dispatch date of the parcel",
      "value": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Party: Mira Solen",
      "value": "Mira Solen"
    },
    {
      "text": "Tracking number: EE482716395IN",
      "value": "EE482716395IN"
    },
    {
      "text": "Carrier: Pos Indonesia",
      "value": "Pos Indonesia"
    }
  ]
}
